This directory contains the Wan2.1 model code used by the VideoCoF student backend. No weights
are included (Wan2.1-T2V-14B, the VideoCoF LoRA and the FusionX acceleration LoRA are downloaded
separately).

Third-party code inside (see NOTICE): diffusers schedulers (utils/fm_solvers*.py), TeaCache
(models/cache_utils.py), RIFLEx (models/wan_transformer3d.py), LoRA reference implementations
(utils/lora_utils.py).

Local modifications:
- imports rewritten to live under i2vt.vendor.wan; __init__.py files export only the vendored
  modules; the Wan2.1 config ships as package data; modules the backends do not use are left out;
- utils/fm_solvers_unipc.py keeps Wan's sigma schedule and flow conversion but reuses the
  diffusers solver updates;
- models/attention_utils.py: flash attention runs its deterministic backward when
  torch.use_deterministic_algorithms is on.
